  nonce: d8bc  # d8bc
  message: "2026-09-18: this row's title cites \"ADR-0012 coexistence, spec s20\". That\ncitation was retracted from the spec in PR #1044 (WI-kanuh): ADR-0012\ncontains no ruling on backend coexistence at the symbol level, and the\nRust arm coexists with tree-sitter by DEFAULT (nothing merges or\nreconciles), not by decision. A second backend built \"on the Rust\nprecedent\" inherits the same open question — two records per construct with\nindependent identities (INV-dolud: 0 of 52 parity in Rust) — and, until\nWI-gojum is unparked or a new ADR rules, would be building on no ruling.\nAlso noted last session: this row's own value-prop (receiver typing)\nmeasured zero in the Rust arm. Not started; priority unchanged (owner's)."  # d8bc
